    design.md §5.7 C2: a notification small icon MUST be a vector, never a bitmap, to stay clear
    of Android 17's `1.5 * screenWidth * screenHeight * 4` RemoteViews Bitmap/Icon memory limit.
    The system renders only this path's alpha channel as a mask and tints it with
    NotificationCompat.Builder#setColor(habit.colorArgb) at post time (task 5.1) — the fill colour
    below is intentionally opaque black and never itself shown.
-->
